## Whole-file declarations, data, registration and contextual obligations (unit-1)

This manual paged-media test gives every page a 7% margin, then overrides only margin-left to 50% on :first and :right pages. Four paragraphs each force a page break afterward. Instructions expect text on pages one and three in the right half and pages two and four near the left edge. The unqualified page rule still provides the other margins. The file supplies paged metadata, specification links, CSS and manual expected text; it defines no script or automated comparison.


